  "english_translation": "At a motor repair workshop, a mechanic lies on a piece of cardboard beneath the wheel well repairing a small car. Nearby grow trees of varying heights with green, brown, and yellow foliage beside a dark-brick building, while small cars and two buses—one red-and-yellow and one white-and-blue—stand along the road.",
